<title>USA: EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 02-JUN.</title>
<headline>EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 02-JUN.</headline>
<text>
<p>Marie is becoming extratropical. It is near 33n/176e in the western Pacific, moving east northeast at 33 mph. Top winds of 65 mph will weaken slowly. This system is a moderate to significant threat to shipping.</p>
</text>
